2024-04-10  The Robot Travis  
	<54914793+travis-ci-opendap@users.noreply.github.com>
	
	beslog2json.awk rewrite (#64)
	- A rewrite of the awk program that encodes a BES log file (all 
	/var/bes/bes.log) in json.
	- Added awk functions to make the stamp and repeat parts of the 
	code utilize a single source of truth.
	- Added controls that allow invocations to control which BES 
	log types will be transmitted as JSON.
	- Added an (optional) prefix that could be used as a namespace 
	to help identify our application variables in the Elastic/Kibana.
	- Added quality checking code to handle incorrectly formatted 
	log lines (what's up with that??) and to elide empty lines.
	Tested by needing this script bes logs and then piping the 
	output into jq
	
